<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-023" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:wine" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:wine:m0000" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">劉公榮</persName>與人飲酒，雜穢非類，人或譏之。答曰：「勝<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:wine:m0023" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">公榮</persName>者，不可不與飲；不如<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:wine:m0035" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">公榮</persName>者，亦不可不與飲；是<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:wine:m0047" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">公榮</persName>輩者，又不可不與飲。」故終日共飲而醉。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:liushi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:liushi:m0000" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">昶</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:liushi:m0002" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">公榮</persName>，沛國人。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:yangqiu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:yangqiu:m0000" ref="z4k_st6_6zf">昶</persName>為人通達，仕至兗州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0000" ref="svm_6fh_34r">裴成公</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0003" ref="cxf_421_onp">婦</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0005" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0007" ref="cxf_421_onp">女</persName>。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0009" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>晨往<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0013" ref="svm_6fh_34r">裴</persName>許，不通徑前。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0021" ref="svm_6fh_34r">裴</persName>從床南下，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:marriage:m0027" ref="cxf_421_onp">女</persName>從北下，相對作賓主，了無異色。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:peishi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:peishi:m0000" ref="svm_6fh_34r">頠</persName>取<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:peishi:m0002" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-023-jin043-wangrong:peishi:m0003" ref="cxf_421_onp">長女</persName>。</p>
</text>
